    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM7YbZmK",
      "title": "feat(devnet-gen): add task generator for devnet OPCM upgrades",
      "author": "Inphi",
      "number": 1415,
      "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\nAdds `just gen-devnet-task` — a Python tool under `src/script/devnet-gen/` that generates devnet ops task directories from existing Solidity templates plus a path to a devnet in the [devnets](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/devnets) repo. Two adapters ship: `OPCMUpgradeV600` and `OPCMUpgradeV800`.\r\n\r\n## Why\r\n\r\nAlmost every input a devnet upgrade task needs is already in the devnets repo — per-chain L1 addresses in `chain.yaml`, prestates in `op-program/prestates.json`, OPCM in `op-deployer/state.json`. Hand-copying these into a fresh `src/tasks/sep/` task is rote and error-prone; this automates it.\r\n\r\n## Usage\r\n\r\n```bash\r\njust gen-devnet-task list\r\njust gen-devnet-task info OPCMUpgradeV800\r\njust gen-devnet-task OPCMUpgradeV600 ../devnets/alphanets/u18-alpha\r\njust gen-devnet-task OPCMUpgradeV800 ../devnets/alphanets/u18-alpha \\\r\n    --override initBond=0 --override startingRespectedGameType=1\r\n```",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
      "createdAt": "2026-05-05T14:17:39Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 2896,
      "deletions": 4
    },
